<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="40" width="600" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(0,112,186)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" bold="true"><p>01 · 背景与定位</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" width="840" height="56"><content textType="headline" fontSize="24" color="rgb(0,28,84)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>订单、定价、库存与对账被收敛为一条可测试的数据流</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="128" endX="900" endY="128"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="170" width="80" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="15" color="rgb(0,48,135)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" bold="true"><p>定位</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="150" topLeftY="170" width="750" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><p>库存与订单分析的教学 / 评审项目，运行时无第三方依赖，Python 3.10+ 即可运行</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="214" endX="900" endY="214"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="242" width="80" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="15" color="rgb(0,48,135)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" bold="true"><p>输入</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="150" topLeftY="242" width="750" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><p>CSV / JSON 订单与客户数据：tests/fixtures/orders.csv、orders.json、customers.csv</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="286" endX="900" endY="286"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="314" width="80" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="15" color="rgb(0,48,135)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" bold="true"><p>输出</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="150" topLeftY="314" width="750" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><p>行级定价、库存校验结果，以及 services/report 生成的财务对账报表</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="358" endX="900" endY="358"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="386" width="80" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="15" color="rgb(0,48,135)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" bold="true"><p>运行</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="150" topLeftY="386" width="750" height="26"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><p>PYTHONPATH=src python3 -m invana.cli summary tests/fixtures/orders.csv</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="430" endX="900" endY="430"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="470" width="840" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>数据来源：repo-invana 仓库实际目录（src/invana、tests、docs）</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="498" endX="900" endY="498"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="506" width="500" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>invana 项目介绍 · 技术评审</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="506" width="100" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="right" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>03 / 